<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sales Force Objectives Definition Sales Force Objectives Definition Function defines the direct (Customer Service Representatives - CSR - in call centers and shops) and indirect (dealers, resellers, outsourcers) sales forces objectives. 
It consists in planning their activities, their visits with customers as well as some indicators about their efficiency in achieving the goals of a marketing campaign.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

