<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sales Account Planning Sales Account Planning looks at the service providers complete relationship with a large customer. This includes the customers outages, revenues, opportunities in the pipeline, etc. It allows the account executive to effectively manage the service providers relationship with the customer and to plan the selling strategy going forward.</rdf:label>
