<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Campaign Workflow Execution Campaign Workflow Execution provides an event evaluation and trigger function that ensure that campaigns and campaign stages (waves) are executed at critical points in the customer lifecycle.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

