<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sales Opportunities Dispatching Sales Opportunities Dispatching creates and dispatches opportunities to relevant employees/sales personnel. Captures customer information and qualifies leads according to the guidelines set by your company (cf Customer Information Management). Sales opportunities are dispatched to sales representatives in the field.</rdf:label>
