<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Late Arrival Usage Charges/Credits Recalculation Late Arrival Usage Charges/Credits Recalculation provides recalculation of charges/credits based on information received later (e.g. from the Service Level Agreement function, delayed call detail record file arrival, delayed order arrival). Recalculation may be necessary: pre-billing (prior to Bill Calculation), during the Bill Calculation process, and/or post-billing.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

