<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Loyalty Product Events Collection Loyalty Product Events Collection Function collects the events defined by the Loyalty Product (nature and perimeter). Examples: monthly international usage volume, amount of the invoice, customer orders, interactions, customer birthday...</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

