<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Mass Product Pre-activation Mass Product Pre-activation of services to prepare for a swift activation at sales. E.g sub-sequent affiliate sales.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

