<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Product QoS Dashboard Analysis Product QoS Dashboard Analysis Function develops a global "Dashboard" in order to analyze the quality / efficiency of the service provided to the customers, measure the customer satisfaction and analyze their claims and/or troubles.
