<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Financial Customer Score Updating Financial Customer Score Updating updates the customer scoring information, based on events that are significant of payer behavior of the customer (e.g. late payment, delays, etc.).</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

