<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Collection Issue Write Off Closing Collection Issue Write Off Closing provides various reports regarding Fallout Management about issue write-offs (in order to close the dunning file) and to inform the Account Receivable system about the entries to be done, including statistics on fallout per various times periods (per hour, week, month, etc) as well as information about specific fallout.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

