<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Self-service Portal Access Customer Self-service Portal Access function allows Customers, whether individual or corporate, direct online access to account services, subscription configuration and/or applications that are made available to them. Such access could be provided either through a web interface or an installed application.</rdf:label>
