<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Collaboration Blogging Collaboration Blogging is a website formed to present a writer's or group of writers' contributions, observations and opinions about common matters for the collaborative community. It also allows for commenting and improvements of the contributed material.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

