<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Order Quote Calculation Customer Order Quote Calculation Function enables the elaboration of an estimate, including configuration, pricing and feasibility elements, thanks to the specific configuration, eligibility and valuation functions, identifying the various relevant interlocutors (through the Sales Interlocutors Management function), the scenarios to be realized and the lot.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

