<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Details Management Customer Details Management Function is in charge of collecting customer details - E.g. name, contact persons for this customer, account managers for this customer, addresses (residence, billing, service address, etc.), contact phone numbers (landline, mobile, fax, etc.)
Note: All person information creation and updating are managed by Party Repository Management Functions.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

