<TMF_v1:hasUID rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">3553</TMF_v1:hasUID>
<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Order Entry Finalization The Customer Order Entry Finalization function enables finalization the Customer Order with collection of Customer Data or installed base data according to the Catalog. It allows to complete the configuration element not necessary for the quotation. The complements could also concern links with actors, dates, address, billing account.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

