<TMF_v1:hasUID rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">3921</TMF_v1:hasUID>
<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Dunning Scenario Specification Design The Dunning Scenario Specification Design function is meant to define the dunning scenario specification which describes the companys dunning strategy.
It describes the dunning actions to be applied to a case, the order in which these actions should be performed, the interval between two actions.
It describes the dunning actions to be applied to a case, the order in which these actions should be performed, the interval between two actions.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

