<TMF_v1:hasID rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">174</TMF_v1:hasID>
<TMF_v1:hasUID rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">3929</TMF_v1:hasUID>
<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Ordering Customer Order Error Resolution Ordering Customer Order Error Resolution provides to view pool of orders resulted in error or stuck orders during ordering and enable the Customer Support to act accordingly.
For example, a configuration incompatibility with functional or commercial constraint, product unavailability according to the configuration may trigger the resend of the request or notify the user with recommended action.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

