<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Order Take-over Management Customer Order Take-over Management provides an ability to take over governance of orders handled by other channels (e.g. self service) amend and relinquish, while preserving all the captured data.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

