<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Work Item Sequence Execution To carry through an orchestration task the items of the task need to be performed in a specific order. This application function will perform the workflow according to configuration.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

