<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Service Assurance Trouble Mitigation Service Assurance Trouble Mitigation have autonomic rules to minimize the lack of service by doing mitigation action e.g. restart or re-routing etc. to mitigate the negative impact for the customer from a service problem or fall-out.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

