<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Activation Notification Activation Notification function provides notifications on successful activation and, in cases of exceptions, sends fallouts to Service Order Orchestration and manages rollbacks activities (if applicable).</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

