<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">AI Model Cataloging AI Model Cataloger is a function to organize and catalogs AI models for easy retrieval and use. It tags models with relevant metadata or categorizing them based on certain criteria.
