<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Location Data Integrity Management Location Data Integrity Management provides ability to maintain data integrity in the whole location repository. Its especially important if there are many external data sources that deliver new addresses for the repository.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

