<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Number Portability Orchestration Number Portability Orchestration is a communication mechanism that ensures the Resource Number orders activation according to a criteria set, allowing in this way the correct execution of orders.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

