<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Resource Response Capture Measurement Resource Response Capture Measurement measures the quantity and quality of the responses of the resources with verification instrumentation.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

