<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Network Planning Analyzing Network Planning Analyzing provides complex algorithmic and heuristic analysis capability for network planning and make use of market forecasts and utilization trends, and can be used to optimize the network for capacity and resilience.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

