<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Resource Deployment and Retirement Resource Deployment and Retirement Function is responsible for implementing the resource strategy high level plan and develop the resource infrastructure (network, PFS, IT...). 

The Resource Installed Base is updated and the resources are pre-configured and pre-activated if needed, for example for non-customer specific parameters, via the Resource Order Initialization and Installed Resource Management functions.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

