<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Resource Order Initiation Resource Order Initiation function issues valid and complete resource orders, and stores the order into an appropriate data store. As part of order publication, additional data might be obtained or derived to support downstream functions that are not provided in the resource order request.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

