<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Stock Item Receiving Management Stock Item Receiving Management provides logistics management functionality controlling quality of resources received from suppliers' or from movements coming from a warehouse (quantity, status).
It also includes controlling materials returned by customers.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

