<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Stock Item Availability Check Stock Item Availability Check Function allows one to:

	Check the availability of tangible products in warehouses
	Get the delivery duration 

For this function, the supply chain uses its own stock and delivery duration, but also the stock and delivery duration of its partners.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

