<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Business Partner Product Relationship Management The Business Partner Product Relationship Management Function manages relationships between Products bought from the Business Partner with the CSP's (Customer Service Provider) different level of installed base (Product, Know-How a.k.a CustomerFacingService, Technical Solution a.k.a ResourceFacingService and Resource).</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

