<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Partnership Reporting Partnership Reporting provides reporting of partner related information as appropriate concerning orders, trouble tickets, campaign and sales results, product usage, billing data, inquiries on products, product feedback, as well as lead and opportunity data. This information can be made available to relevant service provider or partner staff and systems.</rdf:label>
