<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Partner Financial Risk Analyzing Partner Financial Risk Analyzing function supports the assessment of potential financial risks associated with partners before making any new business engagement. The analysis is done based on financial information, both collected and recent, for the relevant partner profile, group and hierarchy.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

