<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Business Partner Settlement Management Business Partner Settlement Management calculates settlements amounts according to what the CSP owes to the Business Partner (for Offers bought to the BP and for Revenue Sharing) and what is owed by the Business Partner to the CSP (for what has been bought by the BP to the CSP and for Revenue sharing).</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

