<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Accounting Event Creation The Accounting Event Creation function sends information produced by rating and/or invoicing functions to the accounting functionality, including the period end (a.k.a. cut-off) accounting entries.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

