<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Journal Entry Accumulation Journal Entry Accumulation accumulates journal entries and maps them to the GL transaction based on criteria such as appropriate geographical accounting principles for sending downstream to the corporate general ledger.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

