<TMF_v1:hasUID rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">2119</TMF_v1:hasUID>
<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">BI Data Modeling The BI Data Modeling function provides support for modeling information to organize it in database schemas that support Business Intelligence.  This generally includes relating  the data to pre-defined reference data and dimensions, and designing schemas and structures that optimize query performance and facilitate reporting.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#F.Anomaly Pattern Collection -->

