<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Prediction Data Collection This function collects the data that will be used for prediction. It takes as input raw data optimized for anomaly prediction, and outputs a dataset that is ready for anomaly prediction processing actions.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

