<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Anomaly Prediction Reporting This function generates anomaly prediction reports summarizing the prediction results based on a given period. The input is a period of focus, with the interpreted prediction results and the output is a report summarizing anomaly prediction results.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

