<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Pattern Detection Context Capture Pattern Detection Context Capture function is used to capture context of relevance to the user or endpoint to categorize for operations. Input is human/machine provided target physical/logical resource, and output is a confirmation of capture of context,</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

