<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Fallout Reporting Fallout Reporting provides various reports regarding Fallout Management, including statistics on fallout per various times periods (per hour, week, month, etc) as well as information about specific fallout.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

