<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Privacy Data Browsing Access Privacy Data Browsing Access provides a Privacy Dashboard access to Privacy Data Browsing used to provide the "Data Subject Party" the ability to view the current privacy profile attributes, of the Privacy Profile, both associated default values of rules defined, and the current values of rules.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

