<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Business Intelligence Analysis Result Notification Business Intelligence Analysis Result Notification assist the delivery functions by sending alerts to Customers/Users about new or changed Analytics, Metrics, KPI etc. data according to requested criteria.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

