<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Data Entity Access Data Entity Access provides reading and updating data including transformation and formatting from/to Data Store formats. The activities are logged according to the compliance and policies.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

