<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Business Process Simulation Business Process Simulation function enables the testing and validation of the defined processes prior to deployment through process simulation. Errors, or trouble areas, are identified and solutions are recommended.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

