<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">API Catalog Management Application Programming Interface Catalog Management function is a technical/commercial API Catalog as an implementation of Catalog Management (11.1) containing metadata related to: 

	API creation driven by project definition templates and configuration wizards,
	API dependencies registry,
	API search,
	API contracts management,
	API proxies and stubs code-generators,
	etc.
</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

