<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">API Gateway Diagnosis API Gateway Diagnosis function diagnoses tasks dynamically and updates underlying management systems such as the Windows Management Instrumentation performance counters so that they can be monitored and reported upon by the monitoring service.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

