<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">API Gateway Log Reporting Application Programming Interface Gateway Log Reporting function gives the possibility to deliver the log information in different channels and offer great flexibility for both operation and debug scenarios. E.g. to 3rd party for the sake of visualization of API usage or security audit etc. by itself or for Call Detail Record reporting for calculating API usage fee.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#F.API Gateway Protocol Header Transformation -->

